```

### Where it happened
The failure occurred when `X_train.skb.apply(model, y=y_train)` tried to fit CatBoost, which then crashed while converting the first feature to float.

### Summary
CatBoost received a non-numeric string feature (`"2513_01"`) in a numeric feature slot, causing training to fail.
